{v:'VER',what:'kit3, his word on BEST KIT: his three best guns by the colour they wear, then tier, then worth, three different models, the best in hand, the second in the other hand, the third packed, each on its class key; and up to three of each wheel item from the stash in wheel order, the Armour only with a rig that holds plates, the biggest Ammo Box, never more than the pack room',
 run:function(){
   if(!(window.__P&&window.__applyLoaded)) return 'SKIP: this fixture has no profile';
